{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00062","headline":"班婕妤（一作严武诗） · 严识玄","name":"班婕妤（一作严武诗）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贱妾如桃李，君王若岁时。秋风一已劲，摇落不胜悲。 寂寂苍苔满，沈沈绿草滋。繁华非此日，指辇竞何辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严识玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「班婕妤」条，撰者刘友竹、与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"刘友竹"}